abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.3.0 is a backward-compatible minor release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It adds opt-in, request-bound signed capability grants for ASP.NET Core endpoints, including token encoding, signing helpers, replay-aware validation, audit correlation, and configured development keys. Existing hosts are unchanged unless they opt in; package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0 remain unchanged."
